Auth & Sessions:
  iron-session                     Encrypted cookie sessions
                                   Admin: hyperbite-admin-session (8hr)
                                   Student: hyperbite-student-session (2hr, UI enforces 3-min inactivity)

Security:
  bcryptjs                         Password + PIN hashing (cost factor 10)

QR Code:
  qrcode (npm)                     Server-side QR SVG generation for student cards
  jsQR (npm)                       Browser-based QR decoding via canvas (kiosk camera)
  getUserMedia (browser API)       Camera access for kiosk QR scanning

Rate Limiting:
  src/lib/rate-limit.ts            In-memory rate limiter (single-instance, no Redis needed)
                                   Student login: 10 req/min per IP + 5 wrong PINs → 15-min account lock
                                   Cashless identify: 30 req/min per IP

Other:
  html5-qrcode (npm)               Installed but replaced by jsQR — can remove

