- Admin activity logging: freeze/unfreeze, PIN reset, QR regen not logged.
  Top-ups and order edits/cancels ARE logged. Add StudentAccountLog model
  (studentAccountId, action, adminId, createdAt) for full admin audit trail.

- Stronger kitchen access: /kitchen PIN gate uses sessionStorage — clears on
  browser close but no server-side session. Add proper server session for kitchen
  staff (similar to admin session).

- Online hosting: SQLite → PostgreSQL, HTTPS via Let's Encrypt, deploy to VPS
  or Railway/Render. Required for student portal access outside school Wi-Fi.
  NOTE: camera QR scanning requires HTTPS — getUserMedia blocked on plain HTTP.

- MIS integration: validate student ID numbers against school's student
  information system on registration. Currently admin verifies face-to-face only.

- Daily spending limit per student account (e.g. max ₱500/day).

- Email/SMS notification on payment, low balance, or failed login attempts.

- P2P student credit transfer (deliberately excluded — weakens accountability model).

- QR code printed directly on physical student ID card (requires MIS partnership).

- Multi-admin support: currently one admin account. Add role-based access
  (admin vs staff) — staff can confirm orders and top up, admin manages everything.

- Rate limiter uses in-memory Map — resets on server restart. For production with
  restarts, consider persistent rate limiting (Redis or DB-backed).

